WEBVTT

00:00:00.940 --> 00:00:03.950
Oh, you stupid rainy season, you!

00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:07.670
I knew I should have looked 
at the weather forecast!

00:00:07.670 --> 00:00:10.300
I'm such a klutz, tee-hee!

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:13.590
<i>I'm Saotome Roman, 17 years old!</i>

00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:14.440
*splish*

00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:17.330
<i>What? Why am I suddenly introducing myself?</i>

00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:20.680
<i>And who am I talking to anyway, you ask?</i>

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:21.960
<i>Nonsense!</i>

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:24.270
<i>Just don't think too much about it!</i>

00:00:24.270 --> 00:00:27.040
<i>Anyway, I feel like something 
good's gonna happen to me today!</i>

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:28.410
<i>Although it's already evening...</i>

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:33.680
My, look at how dirty you've gotten...

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:34.600
<i>*thump*</i>

00:00:35.450 --> 00:00:37.470
Hey, stop it... Enough already.

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:38.830
<i>*kathump*</i>

00:00:39.410 --> 00:00:42.630
I see... You're all by yourself, too.

00:00:42.630 --> 00:00:43.680
<i>*pang*</i>

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:47.730
I've found you, my prince!

00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:51.020
Caution: This anime is Sket Dance.

00:02:21.400 --> 00:02:23.700
Here's your ugly-ass towel back.

00:02:21.550 --> 00:02:25.610
<b>Episode 4: Romantic! Finding the Hilltop Pelolin!</b>

00:02:23.960 --> 00:02:25.500
Hey, what'd you just call it?

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:29.470
You're the one who forgot an 
umbrella yesterday and borrowed it!

00:02:29.470 --> 00:02:32.330
As if one little towel's gonna help.

00:02:32.330 --> 00:02:35.670
And who has such bad taste they carry around 
something with a purple and brown logo?!

00:02:36.370 --> 00:02:38.300
It's a Pelocan special prize!

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:41.020
Purple and brown is eggplant 
and grilled miso-flavored!

00:02:41.280 --> 00:02:43.790
You mean each flavor has its own colors?

00:02:43.790 --> 00:02:45.850
That's a lotta effort for that crap.

00:02:45.850 --> 00:02:48.330
Hey, it's a little dirty!

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:49.990
You got it dirty, didn't you?

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:53.410
I kinda dropped it in a puddle...

00:02:53.410 --> 00:02:55.050
But I made sure to wash it!

00:02:55.050 --> 00:02:56.320
Oh, you did, did you?

00:02:56.570 --> 00:02:58.570
I washed it, for real!

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:00.400
*kya*

00:03:01.170 --> 00:03:02.880
Ow...

00:03:04.900 --> 00:03:06.990
Owwy!

00:03:06.990 --> 00:03:09.310
Oh, sorry 'bout that.

00:03:09.570 --> 00:03:10.410
You okay?

00:03:11.220 --> 00:03:13.070
Oh, don't worry about me...

00:03:13.070 --> 00:03:13.690
*kya*

00:03:13.690 --> 00:03:14.870
D-Don't look!

00:03:14.870 --> 00:03:15.630
*ehe*

00:03:15.630 --> 00:03:16.790
Sorry!

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:18.350
This is... old-school.

00:03:18.350 --> 00:03:19.800
And what happened next?

00:03:21.360 --> 00:03:24.010
So, uh... What's your name?

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:26.510
<i>I'm Saotome Roman!</i>

00:03:26.510 --> 00:03:28.290
Uh, not like that.

00:03:28.290 --> 00:03:31.370
Wait, that's awesome! How do you do that?

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:33.170
I can also do this!

00:03:33.170 --> 00:03:34.360
<i>17 years old!</i>

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:37.830
What's with this girl? Is 
she puttin' on a show?!

00:03:37.830 --> 00:03:39.820
What the hell did you come here for, anyway?

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:41.400
You got a request or what?

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:42.010
Yes.

00:03:42.670 --> 00:03:45.130
You see, there's someone I'd 
like you to find for me.

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:48.760
I think he's someone from this school, but...

00:03:48.760 --> 00:03:51.490
In that case, Switch can search for 
him in his database, no problem.

00:03:52.570 --> 00:03:53.750
What's his name?

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:56.790
The Hilltop Prince.

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:59.970
Let's see here... Hilltop...

00:04:01.020 --> 00:04:02.650
W-What?

00:04:02.650 --> 00:04:05.600
You've never heard of the Hilltop Prince?

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:07.000
Hell no, I haven't!

00:04:08.070 --> 00:04:09.770
We got a real case here, all right.

00:04:10.290 --> 00:04:11.490
Let me explain.

00:04:11.490 --> 00:04:17.430
"Hilltop Prince" is a character who appears 
in the classic shoujo manga "Galando Galando".

00:04:17.430 --> 00:04:20.550
Also, this girl is a member of 
the Girls' Manga Club next door,

00:04:20.550 --> 00:04:23.250
aspires to be a manga artist, and 
has even contributed to magazines.

00:04:23.250 --> 00:04:26.300
My favorite genre is slightly 
older shoujo manga!

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:28.010
Especially the ones that are real classics!

00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:29.510
No wonder...

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:34.530
Sheesh, all the characters in 
this anime are so old-school.

00:04:34.530 --> 00:04:35.560
Hey, stop.

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:37.690
You can't say that out loud, seriously.

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:40.290
I see.

00:04:40.610 --> 00:04:45.400
So you met a guy you ain't never 
seen before in the rain...

00:04:45.400 --> 00:04:47.200
...and fell in love at first sight!

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:50.060
Yes! But I don't know his name 
or what school he goes to...

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:52.870
Even the way you fall in love is cliché!

00:04:52.870 --> 00:04:54.580
Don't make fun of being cliché!

00:04:54.970 --> 00:04:56.480
<i>Don't make fun of me!</i>

00:04:56.990 --> 00:04:58.650
Why'd you do it again?

00:04:58.650 --> 00:05:01.330
She's cute, but annoying.

00:05:01.330 --> 00:05:04.870
All girls can't help but get excited 
at clichéd turns of events!

00:05:05.390 --> 00:05:08.500
And when I get into clichéd situations,

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:11.330
I always look at things as 
if they were shoujo manga...

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:15.760
I call that my "Otome Filter".

00:05:15.760 --> 00:05:16.290
*sparkle*

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:18.580
Please stop doing that!

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:20.650
We're not getting anywhere!

00:05:20.650 --> 00:05:26.080
Anyway, if we don't have any clues about 
this prince, we don't know where to start.

00:05:26.080 --> 00:05:28.300
Do you remember any special 
features about him?

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:30.380
Let me think...

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:34.560
I'd say his body was 
pretty much thin overall.

00:05:34.560 --> 00:06:01.790
<b>Otome Filter</b>

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:37.380
A delicate sharp,

00:05:37.380 --> 00:05:39.450
but so pointed at times, almost dangerous!

00:05:39.710 --> 00:05:43.100
Yes! If I had to compare, I'd say 
it was like a Zebyura maru-pen!

00:05:43.100 --> 00:05:44.090
Maru?

00:05:44.090 --> 00:05:45.200
No...

00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:47.970
He also needs to have that 
strength at the same time...

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:50.480
So in that case, it's gotta be a G pen!

00:05:50.480 --> 00:05:51.430
G?

00:05:51.430 --> 00:05:53.570
His hands are big and tough,

00:05:53.570 --> 00:05:56.650
like they could even draw an 
urchin flash just like that!

00:05:55.610 --> 00:05:56.650
Urchin!?

00:05:56.650 --> 00:05:59.580
What? And how do you know what he could draw?

00:05:58.730 --> 00:06:01.790
And he's so incredibly 
sensitive, to me he's...

00:06:00.820 --> 00:06:02.340
Whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:03.590
Hold it, sister!

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:06.000
I don't know what the hell 
you're talking about!

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:08.040
What in the world is "maru" or "G"?

00:06:08.040 --> 00:06:09.330
Some kind of manga tools?

00:06:09.330 --> 00:06:10.900
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:06:11.230 --> 00:06:13.020
A brand new G-pen, see...

00:06:13.020 --> 00:06:15.570
It can draw even finer lines than a maru-pen.

00:06:15.570 --> 00:06:17.190
Maybe that was a little hard to understand.

00:06:17.190 --> 00:06:18.070
Uh, no!

00:06:18.070 --> 00:06:20.230
I mean, yes, that was hard to understand, 
but that's not what I meant!

00:06:21.880 --> 00:06:23.860
We're up against a tough one here.

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:25.780
My comebacks aren't enough...

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:29.900
I'll help you out today. We'll tag-team her!

00:06:29.900 --> 00:06:31.890
A-And...

00:06:31.890 --> 00:06:33.990
Actually, I drew his face.

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:35.380
Oh, there you go!

00:06:35.380 --> 00:06:37.860
You're in the Manga Club, so 
I bet you're good at drawing.

00:06:37.860 --> 00:06:43.470
However, would it be wise to place our trust 
in the image she saw through her Otome Filter?

00:06:43.470 --> 00:06:45.870
Idiot! Shut up, you dolt.

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:48.360
She aims to be a manga artist.

00:06:48.360 --> 00:06:49.890
I'm sure she drew 'im fine.

00:06:49.890 --> 00:06:52.730
Yeah, I think it's gonna go that way.

00:06:52.730 --> 00:06:55.180
You know, where she's 
actually <i>really</i> terrible.

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:57.390
No, no, no! No way.

00:06:57.390 --> 00:06:59.440
There's no way we're gonna 
use such a lame gag!

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:01.300
That wouldn't be funny in the slightest!

00:07:01.300 --> 00:07:02.390
Um...

00:07:02.670 --> 00:07:06.310
Well, maybe you could just take a look at it?

00:07:06.310 --> 00:07:08.030
R-Right...

00:07:18.630 --> 00:07:20.230
I knew it!

00:07:20.230 --> 00:07:21.950
What's with the big reveal?!

00:07:21.950 --> 00:07:26.040
I'm sorry... My drawings 
are so old-fashioned...

00:07:26.040 --> 00:07:30.050
Uh... Not exactly old-fashioned...

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:31.550
You are such a pain!

00:07:32.070 --> 00:07:34.910
Anyway, old-school shoujo 
manga is more like...

00:07:34.910 --> 00:07:37.880
Oh yeah, you're good at drawing Bossun.

00:07:38.210 --> 00:07:39.710
Like this, right?

00:07:39.710 --> 00:07:40.810
Damn, you're good!

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:43.180
This is great!

00:07:43.180 --> 00:07:45.580
You're amazing! Why don't you draw?

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:48.300
Huh? Everybody can draw 
something like this...

00:07:48.300 --> 00:07:49.320
Hell no, they can't!

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:50.450
What planet are you on?!

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:54.570
Okay, next draw a cat! Try drawing a cat!

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:56.690
Huh? Why?

00:07:56.690 --> 00:07:57.690
We're searchin' for a Prince...

00:07:57.150 --> 00:07:58.000
Whatever!

00:07:58.000 --> 00:07:59.560
Get that pen a-movin' on the double!

00:07:59.560 --> 00:08:01.730
L-Let me draw one, too!

00:08:01.730 --> 00:08:03.560
I have my pride, at least!

00:08:03.560 --> 00:08:04.930
That's the spirit!

00:08:04.930 --> 00:08:06.610
I'll draw, too!

00:08:06.610 --> 00:08:08.120
Fine with you, Bossun?

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:09.960
Fine, fine...

00:08:10.260 --> 00:08:11.670
So, what breed?

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:12.640
Breed?

00:08:12.640 --> 00:08:15.790
O-Oh, you can draw different kinds?

00:08:16.250 --> 00:08:18.600
How about that one?! You 
know, a Scottish Fold!

00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:21.730
What?! That one's kind of complicated...

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:24.570
If I remember right, it's 
got ears that hang down...

00:08:24.570 --> 00:08:26.270
What a pain...

00:08:26.270 --> 00:08:40.620
<b>Otome Filter</b>

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:29.110
He's gruff and rude,

00:08:29.110 --> 00:08:31.780
but maybe he's actually a very 
skilled and delicate person?

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:33.900
He kind of looks like...

00:08:34.510 --> 00:08:36.910
No! Stupid Roman, you!

00:08:36.910 --> 00:08:39.150
You've got to shut off your Otome Filter now!

00:08:39.150 --> 00:08:39.880
*ehe*

00:08:41.340 --> 00:08:42.790
Something like this?

00:08:43.420 --> 00:08:44.940
Damn, you're good!

00:08:44.940 --> 00:08:47.660
It's like, I see you in a whole new light...

00:08:48.110 --> 00:08:49.990
Hey, don't say that!

00:08:49.990 --> 00:08:51.450
I'm the main character!

00:08:51.450 --> 00:08:55.630
Having the main character's special skill 
being "good at drawing" is so lame...

00:08:55.630 --> 00:08:57.140
Shut up, you!

00:08:57.140 --> 00:09:00.020
Besides, you're supposed to be the straight 
man, but you're turnin' into the goofy one!

00:09:00.020 --> 00:09:02.100
And all the guest characters are weirdos!

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:03.530
My... My place is...

00:09:03.530 --> 00:09:05.410
I-I've finished drawing!

00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:09.020
Yup, you suck!

00:09:09.020 --> 00:09:11.800
The ears are all floppy!

00:09:11.800 --> 00:09:14.110
Damn it... Am I even needed?

00:09:15.330 --> 00:09:17.600
And hey, you suck, too!

00:09:17.600 --> 00:09:20.370
I told you. I can't draw no pictures.

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:22.810
Switch, huh?

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:26.160
You drew it okay, I guess.

00:09:26.160 --> 00:09:27.530
It's half-assed!

00:09:27.530 --> 00:09:29.130
And who invited you, anyway?!

00:09:29.130 --> 00:09:32.390
Argh! What the hell have we been doing?

00:09:32.390 --> 00:09:34.380
Weren't we searchin' for this prince?

00:09:34.380 --> 00:09:35.650
Oh, yeah!

00:09:35.650 --> 00:09:38.470
I know. Why don't we first search for clues?

00:09:39.050 --> 00:09:42.640
But at this rate, we're 
gonna come up with nothin'.

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:43.510
I'm sorry.

00:09:44.160 --> 00:09:46.470
Then, maybe I'll give up...

00:09:46.470 --> 00:09:47.620
That being said...

00:09:48.510 --> 00:09:51.300
Why don't we try going to 
where you met this prince?

00:09:51.300 --> 00:09:53.400
Maybe there'll be a hint or something.

00:09:55.560 --> 00:09:56.280
Sure!

00:09:57.520 --> 00:10:00.530
I saw him around here yesterday evening.

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:03.100
Oh? I walked down this street, too.

00:10:03.390 --> 00:10:06.090
He picked up a puppy around here.

00:10:06.090 --> 00:10:08.660
In that case, we should search for that dog.

00:10:09.410 --> 00:10:10.420
What kind of dog was it?

00:10:12.080 --> 00:10:14.450
It was raining, so I couldn't 
see it very well...

00:10:14.450 --> 00:10:16.830
And I'm not sure of the breed...

00:10:16.830 --> 00:10:18.220
But it was purple!

00:10:18.220 --> 00:10:20.140
Purple?!

00:10:20.140 --> 00:10:21.070
B-B...

00:10:21.070 --> 00:10:23.760
There's such a thing as a purple dog?

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:26.720
Yup! It was purple with brown spots!

00:10:26.720 --> 00:10:28.850
What the hell kind of creature is that?

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:30.880
There's no such thing as a dog with...

00:10:32.370 --> 00:10:35.040
Purple and... brown?

00:10:38.510 --> 00:10:40.910
Crap, I dropped it.

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:42.540
And this is Himeko's towel, too...

00:10:43.020 --> 00:10:45.360
Ugh, it's filthy...

00:10:45.360 --> 00:10:47.930
I have to wash it or she'll murder me.

00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:51.190
<b>Otome Filter</b>

00:10:48.720 --> 00:10:51.050
My, look at how dirty you've gotten!

00:10:53.930 --> 00:10:55.080
Eww!

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:57.830
Dang, it smells like a mop...

00:10:57.600 --> 00:11:01.140
<b>Otome Filter</b>

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:01.370
Hey, stop it... Enough already.

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:05.250
It was me?!

00:11:05.250 --> 00:11:08.470
Come on, let's search for this purple dog.

00:11:08.470 --> 00:11:10.180
I'll check on the Net.

00:11:10.430 --> 00:11:12.640
But purple?

00:11:12.640 --> 00:11:14.330
That's one weird dog.

00:11:14.330 --> 00:11:15.910
Maybe it's poisonous?

00:11:16.890 --> 00:11:18.500
What is it, Bossun?

00:11:18.500 --> 00:11:20.220
You look like an idiot.

00:11:20.460 --> 00:11:23.640
Uh, see, Roman-chan...

00:11:23.640 --> 00:11:25.740
That guy, he's...

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:29.500
Watch out!

00:11:33.470 --> 00:11:34.920
Are you two okay?

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:37.690
You okay?

00:11:37.750 --> 00:11:39.550
<b>Otome Filter</b>

00:11:38.270 --> 00:11:39.550
Are you all right?

00:11:39.830 --> 00:11:41.690
Whoa, that was scary!

00:11:41.690 --> 00:11:43.860
Watch the road, you damn truck!

00:11:43.130 --> 00:11:46.010
<b>Otome Filter</b>

00:11:43.860 --> 00:11:46.010
I'm so glad you are safe...

00:11:46.010 --> 00:11:47.490
*kathump*

00:11:48.150 --> 00:11:49.760
It was you!

00:11:50.110 --> 00:11:51.810
My prince!

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:54.380
Uh, no...

00:11:54.670 --> 00:11:56.150
I mean, yes, but no!

00:11:56.430 --> 00:11:57.360
Um...

00:11:57.360 --> 00:11:59.360
I believed in my heart we would meet again!

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:00.460
Mmm.

00:12:00.460 --> 00:12:02.700
Hey, hey, what's goin' on here?

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:04.550
So <i>you're</i> the prince?

00:12:04.550 --> 00:12:05.780
I'm not, sheesh!

00:12:05.780 --> 00:12:07.490
It was a towel! Not a dog, a towel!

00:12:07.490 --> 00:12:10.200
Ha ha ha. What is this child 
of ours saying, Mother?

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:12.880
It's true... Our little Bossun 
has finally blossomed...

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:12.290
No, that's not...

00:12:12.880 --> 00:12:13.960
It brings tears to my eyes!

00:12:12.880 --> 00:12:13.960
This is such a pain!

00:12:14.870 --> 00:12:16.540
The show continues after the break!

00:12:16.540 --> 00:12:19.000
Although your role is over.

00:12:19.580 --> 00:12:21.950
Let's close out the bottom of the 4th!

00:12:21.950 --> 00:12:22.970
*thump* *thump*

00:12:23.970 --> 00:12:25.050
All right!

00:12:25.050 --> 00:12:26.840
I got it! I won!

00:12:30.860 --> 00:12:33.500
My horoscope says that Virgo 
is at its strongest today!

00:12:33.720 --> 00:12:36.740
So luck is finally goin' my way...

00:12:36.740 --> 00:12:38.360
I won!

00:12:43.770 --> 00:12:45.280
Hey, hey, hey!

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:47.390
Don't go steppin' over a man's oasis...

00:12:46.550 --> 00:12:47.990
I'm sorry!

00:12:47.990 --> 00:12:49.620
I'm in a hurry to the rear gate...

00:12:51.760 --> 00:12:53.710
Well, fine then...

00:12:54.160 --> 00:12:56.760
Although, I have a Band-Aid if you'd...

00:12:56.070 --> 00:12:57.610
I'm really sorry!

00:13:01.370 --> 00:13:03.740
I hope he likes it!

00:13:09.400 --> 00:13:11.670
Suck it! I ain't won, even once!

00:13:11.670 --> 00:13:13.470
What are the odds anyway, sheesh?

00:13:13.990 --> 00:13:16.950
What is she talking about?

00:13:16.950 --> 00:13:20.670
The wrappers for Pelollipop 
candies are a contest,

00:13:20.670 --> 00:13:24.300
and if you win, you can get a doll 
of their mascot character, Pelolin.

00:13:24.770 --> 00:13:26.580
They got dolls as well as towels?

00:13:26.580 --> 00:13:30.350
Anyway, everyone eats 'em, we win 
the thing, and you hand it over!

00:13:30.350 --> 00:13:31.280
Suck it!

00:13:31.550 --> 00:13:32.690
No thanks.

00:13:32.690 --> 00:13:35.500
I'm afraid I can't handle 
your grotesque palate.

00:13:35.740 --> 00:13:37.670
Ooh, you've gone and said it now!

00:13:37.670 --> 00:13:39.890
As a reward, you get this 
entrails-flavored one!

00:13:40.990 --> 00:13:43.050
And this one's soft-roe ponzu!

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:44.300
It's a rare one, so take it!

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:45.520
Get them away from me!

00:13:46.210 --> 00:13:48.500
Thank goodness, you're all here!

00:13:49.440 --> 00:13:50.590
What's the matter?

00:13:51.080 --> 00:13:53.990
You see, I have a favor to ask!

00:13:54.390 --> 00:13:59.140
Wait, you're saying you 
won the Pelocan contest?

00:13:59.140 --> 00:14:01.170
Yeah. From a mackerel miso-flavored one.

00:14:01.170 --> 00:14:05.890
And I was so overjoyed, I think 
I dropped it on my way home!

00:14:06.620 --> 00:14:08.080
Oh, jeez...

00:14:08.080 --> 00:14:09.990
What've you done, man?!

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:12.130
How could you lose something so important?!

00:14:12.130 --> 00:14:13.900
We gotta find it, and fast!

00:14:14.150 --> 00:14:18.810
But man, argh... I wish I had it...

00:14:18.810 --> 00:14:22.640
Uh, sorry to bring you 
down from your sugar high,

00:14:22.640 --> 00:14:24.590
but it's basically just trash, right?

00:14:24.590 --> 00:14:25.960
It's not trash!

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:28.590
Yeah! It's a winning Pelolin ticket!

00:14:28.590 --> 00:14:31.040
But it's candy with flavors like...

00:14:31.040 --> 00:14:32.890
You get a doll like that and 
your tongue'll be cursed...

00:14:32.890 --> 00:14:37.870
Printed on that slip of paper is something 
more valuable than old man Yukichi's face!

00:14:32.890 --> 00:14:38.000
<b>Note: A portrait of Fukuzawa Yukichi 
is on the current 10,000 yen bill.</b>

00:14:37.870 --> 00:14:38.950
Isn't that right, Captain?

00:14:39.650 --> 00:14:40.790
Yeah...

00:14:40.790 --> 00:14:42.230
But, Himeko-chan...

00:14:42.630 --> 00:14:45.930
It's actually not me who wants the Pelolin...

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:47.480
It's my little brother.

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:49.740
Little brother?

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:53.230
Our mother passed away when we were young,

00:14:53.230 --> 00:14:56.690
so my little brother can get 
very lonely sometimes...

00:14:59.100 --> 00:15:00.630
Look, sis!

00:15:00.630 --> 00:15:03.810
This doll looks kind of like 
that picture of our mom!

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:04.380
<b>Win a Pelolin!</b>

00:15:05.780 --> 00:15:07.010
Yeah, it does.

00:15:07.010 --> 00:15:09.160
Sis, let's buy a whole bunch!

00:15:09.160 --> 00:15:10.940
Then we can win a Pelolin!

00:15:10.940 --> 00:15:13.970
Then I can see Mom again, you know?

00:15:16.640 --> 00:15:19.600
<b>Better luck next time</b>

00:15:18.060 --> 00:15:19.880
Y-Yum... Y-Yum...

00:15:19.880 --> 00:15:25.250
At first he was like that, but he 
continued to eat them day after day...

00:15:25.250 --> 00:15:27.670
I did my best and ate them 
once in a while, too.

00:15:27.670 --> 00:15:29.570
And finally, today, I won!

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:33.040
Finally, I can give my brother a Pelolin...

00:15:33.040 --> 00:15:34.780
The Pelolin that looks like our mother!

00:15:36.220 --> 00:15:38.660
Please, stop! No more!

00:15:38.660 --> 00:15:42.500
We'll find it! We'll find that Pelolin 
if it's the last thing we do!

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:45.250
Thanks, everyone!

00:15:46.470 --> 00:15:49.210
Do you have any idea where you might 
have dropped the winning wrapper?

00:15:49.210 --> 00:15:52.620
Maybe near the back fields. I 
ran into a person there earlier.

00:16:00.450 --> 00:16:01.100
What's this?

00:16:01.100 --> 00:16:02.180
<b>You win</b>

00:16:03.210 --> 00:16:06.280
I dunno what, but looks like I won!

00:16:06.280 --> 00:16:07.520
Lady Luck's seriously with me today!

00:16:08.170 --> 00:16:11.950
Well, honestly, I'm not <i>that</i> happy, but 
maybe I'll make a little prayer to this kami!

00:16:10.620 --> 00:16:14.600
<b>Note: Kami can mean god (神) or paper (紙).</b>

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:14.470
I wish I could meet that girl again!

00:16:14.470 --> 00:16:16.500
Okay, we're gonna find that Pelolin!

00:16:16.500 --> 00:16:17.380
Yeah!

00:16:18.100 --> 00:16:20.360
We'll split up and search!

00:16:22.170 --> 00:16:23.550
It's you guys!

00:16:25.860 --> 00:16:27.810
Wait, you don't remember me?

00:16:27.810 --> 00:16:29.370
You know, the paint guy!

00:16:29.370 --> 00:16:31.510
Oh! Uh...

00:16:31.510 --> 00:16:33.290
J-Joe Kisaragi!

00:16:34.830 --> 00:16:35.990
What?!

00:16:35.990 --> 00:16:39.190
What's with the kinda cool 
name? It's Jougasaki!

00:16:39.190 --> 00:16:40.900
Oh right, that.

00:16:40.900 --> 00:16:43.930
It was kinda too common, 
so I couldn't remember.

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:46.590
W-What?

00:16:46.590 --> 00:16:49.800
Don't worry about it. Even if you're boringly 
common, I'm sure good things are ahead for you.

00:16:49.800 --> 00:16:50.820
For both of us!

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:53.440
Whatever, just get outta here.

00:16:53.440 --> 00:16:55.920
We're lookin' for something 
real important here!

00:16:55.920 --> 00:16:58.020
In fact, why don't you help?

00:16:58.020 --> 00:16:59.440
Hell, no!

00:16:59.440 --> 00:17:01.410
Why would I help you guys?

00:17:01.410 --> 00:17:03.870
Himeko-chan, any luck over there?

00:17:04.850 --> 00:17:06.670
It's the person I ran into before!

00:17:10.360 --> 00:17:12.350
Why am I doing this?

00:17:12.350 --> 00:17:14.510
I'm sorry, it's my fault, so...

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:17.080
Uh, i-it's fine!

00:17:17.080 --> 00:17:19.120
I'm kinda good at this stuff...

00:17:19.590 --> 00:17:21.930
Luck is totally with me today.

00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:23.640
If I play my cards right, then...

00:17:23.640 --> 00:17:25.160
Thank you very much!

00:17:27.610 --> 00:17:29.770
So anyway, what are we looking for?

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:31.060
You didn't know?!

00:17:32.000 --> 00:17:33.280
A winning ticket.

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:35.460
A candy is holding a contest 
where the wrapper is the ticket.

00:17:35.460 --> 00:17:37.030
Winning wrapper?

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:39.280
You've been here the whole time, right?

00:17:39.280 --> 00:17:40.430
See anything?

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:43.580
In that case...

00:17:43.580 --> 00:17:47.080
FYI, the prize is a Pelolin doll,

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:50.380
which can sell for over 100,000 
yen auctioned on the Net.

00:17:57.070 --> 00:17:58.220
Is that so?

00:17:58.220 --> 00:18:01.200
Huh? What're you sweatin' for?

00:18:01.200 --> 00:18:02.640
You're makin' a really weird face...

00:18:02.640 --> 00:18:05.060
N-No... What?

00:18:05.540 --> 00:18:07.240
He's drenched in sweat.

00:18:07.240 --> 00:18:10.230
You're hiding something, 
aren't you, Joe Kisaragi?!

00:18:10.230 --> 00:18:11.150
Joe Kisaragi!

00:18:11.150 --> 00:18:12.490
Joe Kisaragi!

00:18:12.490 --> 00:18:14.250
Who the hell is that?

00:18:14.250 --> 00:18:15.590
Man...

00:18:15.590 --> 00:18:17.620
1-100,000 yen?

00:18:17.620 --> 00:18:19.800
Luck's definitely with me, today!

00:18:20.420 --> 00:18:22.410
Sure is hot out today...

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:25.330
Hey Joe, that ain't a handkerchief.

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:27.810
Yeah, right. It's a wrapper from 
a something miso-flavored...

00:18:28.690 --> 00:18:31.240
W-Wait! I bought it myself!

00:18:31.240 --> 00:18:33.460
I really like these candies!

00:18:33.460 --> 00:18:35.200
Don't screw with us, you bastard!

00:18:35.200 --> 00:18:38.740
Those ain't things someone 
inexperienced should be handling!

00:18:38.740 --> 00:18:40.920
Do you have any idea how 
many times I've puked?

00:18:41.290 --> 00:18:44.100
You thought you were just 
gonna walk away with it, huh?

00:18:44.670 --> 00:18:45.700
Damn it...

00:18:46.620 --> 00:18:48.850
Brought down by the Sket-dan again...?

00:18:49.120 --> 00:18:52.670
Now, be a good boy and hand it over!

00:18:52.670 --> 00:18:53.860
Joe Kisarazu!

00:18:57.070 --> 00:18:58.450
Don't move!

00:18:58.450 --> 00:19:00.900
Come a step closer and I burn it!

00:19:01.710 --> 00:19:03.200
What the...

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:05.400
W-W-Wait a sec... Calm down!

00:19:05.400 --> 00:19:07.500
Yeah, yeah! Don't be so hasty!

00:19:07.500 --> 00:19:10.790
Stop this pointless resistance! 
You'll make your mother cry!

00:19:11.200 --> 00:19:13.900
Shut up! I'm really gonna do it!

00:19:13.900 --> 00:19:16.570
Wait... They're reacting 
better than I figured...

00:19:17.330 --> 00:19:22.260
Okay! Then just do exactly as I say.

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:24.800
First thing, Onihime... Bow down before me!

00:19:26.040 --> 00:19:28.120
That's low, dude!

00:19:28.120 --> 00:19:31.570
Bow down to you? There's no way!

00:19:31.570 --> 00:19:33.020
What should we do?

00:19:33.260 --> 00:19:35.770
So are you gonna do it, or not?

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:39.730
Hey, Bossun... Use that. Your slingshot.

00:19:39.730 --> 00:19:41.290
You can hit it from here, right?

00:19:41.290 --> 00:19:42.670
Sure, I can.

00:19:42.670 --> 00:19:43.640
But...

00:19:45.120 --> 00:19:47.090
I left all my ammo...

00:19:47.090 --> 00:19:48.190
...in the clubroom.

00:19:48.190 --> 00:19:50.330
Aww, how cute!

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:52.090
Now's not the time!

00:19:52.090 --> 00:19:53.400
You ain't cute at all!

00:19:53.400 --> 00:19:57.090
Every damn time you could come 
in handy, you drop the ball!

00:19:57.830 --> 00:20:01.250
Yeah, well... It's not like anybody 
expects me to help, anyway...

00:20:01.250 --> 00:20:02.960
I was like, "whatevers".

00:20:02.960 --> 00:20:05.090
Givin' up? Game Over?!

00:20:05.090 --> 00:20:07.420
H-Hey, you guys!

00:20:08.120 --> 00:20:12.240
We got no other choice! 
Himeko, bow down to him!

00:20:12.240 --> 00:20:13.660
Please, Miss!

00:20:13.660 --> 00:20:16.460
No! Anything but that!

00:20:16.460 --> 00:20:18.630
Then at the least, lick his shoes.

00:20:18.630 --> 00:20:20.050
Please, Miss!

00:20:20.050 --> 00:20:21.550
That's raisin' the bar even higher!

00:20:25.630 --> 00:20:26.640
What's wrong?

00:20:27.430 --> 00:20:30.080
Himeko, this is an order from your leader.

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:32.140
Stop complaining and get down on your knees.

00:20:32.410 --> 00:20:34.380
W-Why should I...

00:20:34.610 --> 00:20:35.670
Believe in me!

00:20:43.570 --> 00:20:46.360
That Onihime has gotten on 
her knees in front of me!

00:20:46.360 --> 00:20:48.560
I can't stop laughing!

00:20:51.240 --> 00:20:52.980
That's enough.

00:20:55.740 --> 00:20:56.650
A Pelocan?

00:20:59.060 --> 00:21:01.980
Just keep laughing like an idiot for me.

00:21:01.980 --> 00:21:04.680
Here I go! Pelocan Shot!

00:21:09.290 --> 00:21:10.870
Soft-roe in bitter orange juice flavor!

00:21:11.720 --> 00:21:12.620
It's a rare one!

00:21:14.180 --> 00:21:15.770
D-Damn you...

00:21:20.630 --> 00:21:22.930
Guess today ain't your lucky day!

00:21:29.770 --> 00:21:30.930
I found it!

00:21:32.310 --> 00:21:33.790
Thank you!

00:21:33.790 --> 00:21:36.880
It's because everyone helped me look for it!

00:21:36.880 --> 00:21:39.430
Huh? What's this mean?

00:21:39.430 --> 00:21:42.230
Then, what's the one that 
Jougasaki picked up?

00:21:42.620 --> 00:21:46.210
Now that I look at it, it's not 
mackerel miso, it's crab miso!

00:21:46.210 --> 00:21:49.200
It seems he picked up a different 
winning wrapper, coincidentally.

00:21:51.110 --> 00:21:54.650
Hey, uh... Can I have this?

00:21:54.650 --> 00:21:55.760
Knock yourself out.

00:21:55.760 --> 00:21:56.750
Pelolin!

00:21:58.800 --> 00:22:02.370
Onihime's got a good side to her, I guess.

00:22:02.370 --> 00:22:04.250
Giving me all these as an apology...

00:22:04.960 --> 00:22:06.670
Vinegar miso flavor...

00:22:06.670 --> 00:22:09.300
I guess that's almost a normal flavor...

00:22:14.190 --> 00:22:17.110
Oh, my! Good luck, Jougasaki-kun!

00:22:17.110 --> 00:22:19.350
I'm sure something good will 
happen to you before long!

00:23:54.110 --> 00:23:56.660
Oh? No one is here...

00:23:59.170 --> 00:24:00.970
Hey, let's play shiritori!

00:23:59.320 --> 00:24:10.420
<b>Shiritori: A game where you say words starting 
with the last letter of the previous word.</b>

00:23:59.320 --> 00:24:10.420
<b>Next Episode: The Ghost of the Incinerator</b>

00:24:00.970 --> 00:24:02.250
Here we go!

00:24:02.250 --> 00:24:04.250
Liver skewer (rebasashi), 
salted fish guts (shiokara),

00:24:04.250 --> 00:24:06.180
egg whites (ranhaku), salted fish (kusaya),

00:24:06.180 --> 00:24:08.850
roasted clam (yakihamaguri), 
rib roast (riburousu)...

00:24:09.800 --> 00:24:10.420
Su...

00:24:12.090 --> 00:24:12.940
Su...

00:24:13.440 --> 00:24:14.490
I love you (suki)!

00:24:14.490 --> 00:24:16.650
The taste of youth, always invigorating!

00:24:16.650 --> 00:24:18.360
Hey everyone, let's have a Pelocan!

00:24:16.650 --> 00:24:19.610
<b>50 winners selected each week!*</b>

00:24:16.650 --> 00:24:19.670
<b>*The Pelolin Contest is a lie</b>

00:24:18.360 --> 00:24:19.600
You can win a Pelolin doll now!

00:24:21.610 --> 00:24:23.610
<b></b>
